Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.18 048/100] ax88179_178a: Check for supported Wake-on-LAN modes
Date:   Tue, 16 Oct 2018 00:11:29 -0400
Message-Id: <20181016041221.135528-48-sashal@kernel.org>
